# [Bash Code]($section.id('bash'))
```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash
name=${name:-"<&>"}
if [[ -n "$name" ]]; then
    printf '%s\n' "$(printf '%s' "$name")"
fi
```

# [JSON Code]($section.id('json'))
```json
{
  "name": "Zine <&>",
  "escaped": "line\nquote=\"",
  "enabled": true,
  "missing": null,
  "value": -1.25e2
}
```

Malformed:

```json
{"unicode":"\u12<&>
```

Incomplete:

```json
[tru
```

# [Diff Code]($section.id('diff'))
```diff
diff --git a/old.txt b/new.txt
--- a/old.txt
+++ b/new.txt
@@ -1 +1 @@
-old <&>
+new "value"
```

Malformed:

```diff
@@ -1 +1
+unterminated <&>
```

Incomplete:

```patch
+++
```

# [TOML Code]($section.id('toml'))
```toml
title = "Zine <&>"
enabled = true
count = 1_024
[package.metadata]
escaped = "line\nquote=\""
```

Malformed:

```toml
[package
value = "unterminated\u12<&>
```

Incomplete:

```toml
enabled = tru
```

# [Dockerfile Code]($section.id('dockerfile'))
```dockerfile
# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1
ARG VERSION=latest
FROM alpine:${VERSION} AS build
COPY --chown=1000:1000 . .
RUN printf '%s' "<&> ${VERSION}" && echo done
CMD ["/bin/app", "--serve"]
```

Malformed:

```dockerfile
FROM alpine AS
RUN echo "unterminated ${NAME} <&>
```

Incomplete:

```dockerfile
RUN echo ${NAME
```

